Building:

Dependencies: GNU bignum (libgmp) and boost threads (libboost)
Tested with gcc v. 4.8.4 (64 bit) 

From the main folder execute

  make

The binary "countAntom" will be created in the source folder

=====================

Usage:

./countAntom [options] cnf_file

Help:

Execute the binary without parameters for an overview of options

